spec:
  id: engineering_instincts
  version: 1.0.0
  status: stable
  priority: highest
  module: Cognition
  compiler_stage: Engineering Intuition
  description: >
purpose[5]: Model,recognize,explain,refine,engineering intuition.
philosophy[7]: Intuition is compressed experience.,Instinct is not magic.,Every instinct,originates from,repeated evidence.,Instinct proposes.,Reasoning verifies.
pipeline[13]: Observation,→,Pattern Recognition,→,Instinct Trigger,→,Confidence Estimate,→,Reasoning,→,Validation,→,Memory Reinforcement
inputs[8]: Observation,Code,Architecture,Metrics,Logs,Memory,Previous Incidents,Engineering Knowledge Records
outputs[6]: Suspicion,Warning,Opportunity,Recommendation,Investigation,Engineering Question
categories[8]: Complexity,Correctness,Performance,Reliability,Security,Scalability,Maintainability,Human
complexity[6]: Too Many Layers,Excessive Abstraction,Hidden Coupling,Unnecessary Generalization,Large Functions,Large Classes
correctness[5]: Missing Validation,Hidden Assumption,Undefined State,Missing Edge Case,Impossible Invariant
performance[5]: Excessive Allocation,Unnecessary Copy,Cache Miss Risk,Synchronization Cost,Serialization Overhead
reliability[5]: Single Point Of Failure,Missing Retry,Missing Timeout,Missing Monitoring,Cascading Failure
security[5]: Excessive Privileges,Missing Authentication,Missing Authorization,Secret Exposure,Trust Boundary Violation
scalability[5]: Global Lock,Centralized Component,Sequential Processing,Hot Partition,Resource Saturation
maintainability[5]: Duplicate Logic,Tight Coupling,Poor Naming,Hidden Dependency,Fragile Interface
human[5]: Bus Factor,Knowledge Silo,Difficult Onboarding,Communication Risk,Ownership Confusion
attributes[7]: identity,category,trigger,confidence,urgency,evidence,explanation
triggers[6]: Pattern Match,Metric Anomaly,Historical Similarity,Constraint Violation,Architecture Smell,Code Smell
actions[7]: Ignore,Investigate,Benchmark,Review,Test,Refactor,Escalate
confidence[4]: Weak,Moderate,Strong,Critical
validation[6]: Static Analysis,Dynamic Analysis,Benchmark,Code Review,Production Evidence,Experiment
memory[4]: Retrieve Similar Instinct,Reinforce Successful Instinct,Weaken Incorrect Instinct,Create New Instinct
learning[4]: Successful Prediction,Failed Prediction,New Pattern,Better Heuristic
ekr:
  description: Every Engineering Knowledge Record
  stores[4]: Triggered Instincts,Validation,Outcome,Confidence Update
rules[8]: Every instinct,has explanation.,Every instinct,is evidence-seeking.,Every instinct,is measurable.,Every instinct,can improve.
examples:
  Example_01:
    Observation: Massive Singleton
    Instinct: Hidden Global State
  Example_02:
    Observation: Nested Loops
    Instinct: Performance Bottleneck
  Example_03:
    Observation: Shared Mutable State
    Instinct: Race Condition Risk
  Example_04:
    Observation: Complex API
    Instinct: Future Maintenance Cost
  Example_05:
    Observation: Missing Timeout
    Instinct: Production Incident Risk
metrics[6]: Prediction Accuracy,False Positive Rate,False Negative Rate,Investigation Success,Engineering Value,Instinct Calibration
success[5]: Engineering intuition,"becomes explicit,","explainable,",measurable,and continuously refined.
guarantees[5]: Explainable Intuition,Pattern Recognition,Early Risk Detection,Experience Transfer,Continuous Instinct Improvement
future:
  instinct_graphs: true
  probabilistic_instincts: true
  collaborative_instinct_learning: true
  organization_specific_instincts: true
  autonomous_instinct_generation: true
